Factorio
--------
Factorio is a game by Wube Software Ltd. "Factorio" is a trademark of Wube
Software Ltd. FactorioGym is an independent project. It is not affiliated with,
sponsored by, or endorsed by Wube Software Ltd.

What this repository contains
-----------------------------
Only original code and data written for this project. It contains no Factorio
game files, source code, art, sound, fonts or save files, and none of those
are covered by the MIT License. The Factorio source code is not public and
none has been copied here.

The Lua under mod/ is an original Factorio mod that uses Factorio's public
modding API. Measurements under docs/evidence/ are numbers this project
recorded by running the game: speeds, timings, counts and the internal names
the game reports, such as "iron-plate".

Using it
--------
Running the environment requires your own legitimate copy of Factorio, or
Wube's headless server, used under Wube's terms of service:
https://www.factorio.com/terms-of-service

Rules for contributors
----------------------
- Never copy code, prototype definitions or data files from the game or from
  other projects whose licence does not allow it.
- Never commit game binaries, graphics, sounds, fonts, locale files, saves, or
  dumps of the game's prototype data.
- Any simulator of game mechanics is written from scratch, from this
  project's own measurements, and draws nothing that imitates the game's look.
